# Sherpa Onnx model integration guidelines

The static libraries and the headers are already pre-built into the 'third_party/sherpa-onnx/static/' folder. For models, due to the size limiation, please download them into 'third_party/sherpa-onnx/models/' folder by running the followings:

```bash
mkdir models && cd models
wget https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/releases/download/asr-models/sherpa-onnx-streaming-zipformer-bilingual-zh-en-2023-02-20.tar.bz2
tar xvf sherpa-onnx-streaming-zipformer-bilingual-zh-en-2023-02-20.tar.bz2
rm sherpa-onnx-streaming-zipformer-bilingual-zh-en-2023-02-20.tar.bz2
```

You can also choose other ASR models from Sherpa Onnx release repository, rather than using the ones provided.